# Normalize line endings. Without this, a Windows checkout writes CRLF and every
# tool that reads the repo on Linux (GitHub Actions, the study session job) sees
# every line of every file as modified. During a 60-day study that commits once
# per session, that churn would bury the log rows the audit trail depends on.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Study logs are append-only evidence. Never let a merge driver touch them.
study/*.csv -merge
study/*.csv text eol=lf

# Binary.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
